-- A natural person: the sentence is about other subscribers.
#ASSERT (`As a company must my legitimate interests about unsolicited messages be protected` WITH `I am a natural person` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- I50: May I bring legal proceedings over an infringement of the national rules on these messages (Art 13(6))?
-- Adversely affected and with a legitimate interest: "may bring legal proceedings".
