§ `Remedies, penalties and enforcement (Articles 15, 15a and 16)`
-- I52: Do the judicial remedies and sanctions of Directive 95/46/EC apply to my rights under this Directive (Art 15(2))?
-- A right derived from this Directive: Chapter III applies.
#ASSERT (`Do the judicial remedies of Directive 95 46 EC apply to my rights under this Directive` WITH `it concerns national provisions adopted under this Directive` IS FALSE, `it concerns a right I have under this Directive` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
