#ASSERT (`Do the judicial remedies of Directive 95 46 EC apply to my rights under this Directive` WITH `it concerns national provisions adopted under this Directive` IS FALSE, `it concerns a right I have under this Directive` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
