-- I57: May my old directory entry stay in a public directory after the new law began (Art 16(2))?
-- A lawful earlier entry, complete information received, not objected: it "may remain included".
#ASSERT (`May my old directory entry stay in a public directory after the new law began` WITH `I am a fixed or mobile voice telephony subscriber` IS TRUE, `I was put in the directory lawfully` IS TRUE, `that was before the national law began` IS TRUE, `I said I want to be removed` IS FALSE, `I was given complete information about purposes and options` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
